section#slider.projects.splide
  div.container.splide__track
    h2.title
      |Projects
    ul.projects__cards-container.splide__list
      li.card.splide__slide 
        .card__img-container
          img.card__img(src="@img/insur.png", alt="insurance")
        .card__specification 
          h2.card__title 
            |Mortage insurance calculator
          h3.card__description 
            |This application allows you to calculate the cost of mortgage risk insurance:
            br
            |- life,
            br
            |- property,
            br
            |- title
          h3.card__skills 
            b 
              |Tech stack: 
            |React, Javascript, SCSS, Primereact
          .card__link 
            a.card__icon-link(href="https://github.com/Igrrrr/insurance-calculator" target="blanc")
              img.card__icon-picture(src="@img/ghblack.svg", alt="github")
            a.card__text-link(href="https://github.com/Igrrrr/insurance-calculator" target="blanc")
              |Repositoriy
      li.card.splide__slide 
        .card__img-container
          img.card__img(src="@img/2wenty1ne.png", alt="2wenty1ne")
        .card__specification 
          h2.card__title 
            |2wenty1ne
          h3.card__description 
            |Layout for subsequent installation on a CMS. Implemented: navigation panel, breadcrumbs, slider, and other reusable site components. Slides are rendered automatically in Splide when reviews are added or removed in reviews.js. The assembly is automated and carried out under the control of Gulp.
          h3.card__skills 
            b 
              |Tech stack: 
            |HTML, JavaScript, SASS, Gulp, Splide, Bootstrap
          .card__link 
            a.card__icon-link(href="https://github.com/Igrrrr/1wenty1ne" target="blanc")
              img.card__icon-picture(src="@img/ghblack.svg", alt="github")
            a.card__text-link(href="https://github.com/Igrrrr/1wenty1ne" target="blanc")
              |Repositoriy
      li.card.splide__slide
        .card__img-container
          img.card__img(src="@img/todo.png", alt="todo")
        .card__specification 
          h2.card__title 
            |toDo
          h3.card__description 
            |The application is designed to manage notes:
            br
            |- task creation: users can add new tasks,
            br
            |- saving tasks in the order they were added: the most recent tasks are always at the top,
            br
            |- marking completed or irrelevant tasks: a checkbox is placed opposite the task,
            br
            |- deleting tasks: user can delete tasks
          h3.card__skills 
            b 
              |Tech stack: 
            |Vue.js, SCSS
          .card__link 
            a.card__icon-link(href="https://github.com/Igrrrr/tz_toDo" target="blanc")
              img.card__icon-picture(src="@img/ghblack.svg", alt="github")
            a.card__text-link(href="https://github.com/Igrrrr/tz_toDo" target="blanc")
              |Repositoriy
